1
00:00:00,850 --> 00:00:05,530
Reaching into a cluttered area can hide the target behind the robot's own hand.
伸向杂乱区域时，目标可能被机器人自己的手遮住。

2
00:00:05,870 --> 00:00:10,390
DexTouch explores grasping, door opening, and valve turning without camera input.
DexTouch探索不用相机的抓取、开门和转阀。

3
00:00:10,650 --> 00:00:15,890
Its policy searches through contact, while still receiving important task and region priors.
策略通过接触搜索，但仍依赖任务和区域先验。

4
00:00:16,427 --> 00:00:20,727
Sixteen force-sensitive resistors cover parts of the fingers and palm.
十六个力敏电阻分布在手指与手掌上。

5
00:00:21,107 --> 00:00:26,267
Filtering and thresholds turn their readings into binary signals indicating whether contact exists.
经过滤波和阈值处理，读数变成二值接触信号。

6
00:00:26,707 --> 00:00:31,747
The policy therefore sees contact events, not a dense three-dimensional shape reconstruction.
策略看到接触事件，而不是密集三维形状重建。

7
00:00:32,560 --> 00:00:38,980
A reinforcement-learning critic and reward can use privileged object information during simulation training.
仿真训练中的评价器与奖励可用物体特权信息。

8
00:00:39,460 --> 00:00:43,120
The actor learns using inputs that will also be available on the robot.
执行策略只学习真机同样可获得的输入。

9
00:00:43,480 --> 00:00:47,920
Separating these roles prevents training knowledge from being mistaken for deployed sensing.
分开这两者，才不会把训练知识当成部署感知。

10
00:00:48,540 --> 00:00:54,820
The robot receives joint and hand kinematics, contact bits, and a specified search region.
机器人读取关节运动学、触点和指定搜索区域。

11
00:00:55,160 --> 00:00:59,220
The task and placement goal are known, even though the object is not seen.
虽然看不见物体，但任务与放置目标已知。

12
00:00:59,580 --> 00:01:05,160
This is structured tactile exploration, not autonomous discovery of an entirely unknown environment.
这是有结构的触觉探索，不是全未知环境自主发现。

13
00:01:05,927 --> 00:01:10,587
The real setup pairs a UR5e arm with an Allegro dexterous hand.
真机平台由UR5e机械臂与Allegro手组成。

14
00:01:11,047 --> 00:01:17,407
Seen-object grasping averages sixty-four percent, while unseen-object grasping averages forty-seven percent.
已见物体抓取平均64%，未见物体为47%。

15
00:01:17,867 --> 00:01:21,747
The gap shows that eliminating vision does not eliminate distribution shift.
这个差距说明，不用视觉并未消除分布变化。

16
00:01:22,306 --> 00:01:28,366
Door opening averages sixty percent success, and valve turning reaches sixty-seven percent.
开门平均成功率60%，转阀为67%。

17
00:01:28,726 --> 00:01:33,446
Reported means and variation summarize policies trained with three different random seeds.
报告的均值与离散程度来自三个训练随机种子。

18
00:01:33,886 --> 00:01:38,426
These are task outcomes, not force accuracy or millimeter-level pose measurements.
这些是任务结果，不是力精度或毫米位姿测量。

19
00:01:39,060 --> 00:01:45,100
A binary touch signal cannot fully describe surface direction, friction, or contact load.
二值触觉不能完整描述表面方向、摩擦或负载。

20
00:01:45,640 --> 00:01:49,400
Heavy or slippery objects can fail even when the hand detects contact.
即使检测到接触，重物或滑物仍可能失败。

21
00:01:49,840 --> 00:01:54,840
Incorrect search-region assumptions can also prevent the first useful contact from happening.
搜索区域假设错误，还会阻止首次有效接触。

22
00:01:55,353 --> 00:02:01,593
DexTouch shows that inexpensive contact coverage can support useful behavior where vision is unavailable.
DexTouch说明，廉价触点覆盖能支持无视觉操作。

23
00:02:02,193 --> 00:02:07,093
For reliable precision work, the remaining uncertainty must still be measured and managed.
若要可靠精细操作，仍需测量和处理剩余不确定性。

24
00:02:07,493 --> 00:02:11,733
More sensors are not the only question; the policy must use the right information.
问题不只是更多传感器，还在于策略用对信息。
